<title>NORWAY: Norway 8-mnth c/a surplus 46.4 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway 8-mnth c/a surplus 46.4 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT			   (billions of crowns)</p>
<p>			    Jan-Aug 1996     Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p> Balance		     46.4		  23.0</p>
<p> Goods/services	    61.5		  40.7</p>
